    "shortDescription": "#scamalert  #scamawareness  #fraudprevention  #ProbateScams #ProbateFraud #InheritanceScam\n\nProbate scams are not always easy to spot. Fraudsters can use real case numbers, personal information and convincing contact details to make fake letters appear legitimate.\n\nIn this video, we highlight how easily information can be altered and share 3 simple steps to help you identify a potential probate scam.\n\nIf you've received a suspicious probate letter, Fraser and Fraser are here to help. Contact our team for free expert guidance and peace of mind.\n\nhttps://www.fraserandfraser.co.uk/contact/"
