  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "Think a probate letter is genuine"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.52,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "because it has a HMCTS number on it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.0,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "text": "Think again."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.28,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "Scammers can make letters look very"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.8,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "official. They may [music] use a"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.16,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "deceased person's real details, an"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.24,
      "duration": 3.515,
      "text": "actual case reference number, and even a"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.24,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "spoof telephone number that appears"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.755,
      "duration": 4.485,
      "text": "[music] legitimate."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.04,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "text": "Look at these two letters. Exact same"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.24,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "text": "information, but one is for 11,000 and"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.28,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "text": "one is for 110 million."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.24,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "And this is how easy it is for scammers"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.2,
      "duration": 3.275,
      "text": "to alter information."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": "Here are some steps you should take"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.475,
      "duration": 2.644,
      "text": "[music] to check if a probate letter is"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.96,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "genuine."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.119,
      "duration": 3.251,
      "text": "Step one, check the sender and details"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.68,
      "duration": 0.88,
      "text": "carefully."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.37,
      "duration": 1.91,
      "text": ">> [music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.56,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": ">> Look for spelling mistakes, unusual"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.28,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "text": "email addresses, or unexpected payment"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.28,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": "requests."
    },
    {
